issue-a-form-element-has-an-aria-labelledby-attribute-but-the-referenced-element-s-tex-7506ed = A <form> element has an aria-labelledby attribute, but the referenced element's text content (or the aria-labelledby value itself) is empty.
issue-a-form-element-relies-on-the-title-attribute-as-its-accessible-name-the-title-at-8feb6c = A <form> element relies on the title attribute as its accessible name. The title attribute is exposed inconsistently — screen readers and mobile users may never receive it.
